From: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 10:15:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: mediatek-gen3: wait after EN7581 PERSTOUT deassert

The EN7581 endpoints need a vendor settling interval after PERSTOUT is
released before probing the link.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6-sol
Signed-off-by: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/pci/controller/pcie-mediatek-gen3.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/pci/controller/pcie-mediatek-gen3.c
+++ b/drivers/pci/controller/pcie-mediatek-gen3.c
@@ -1118,6 +1118,8 @@ static int mtk_pcie_en7581_power_up(struct mtk_gen3_pcie *pcie)
 		goto err_perstout_deassert;
 	}
 
+	msleep(1000);
+
 	return 0;
 
 err_perstout_deassert:
